## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design cross-account, multi-region governance for GPU workloads with cost and security constraints, using AWS Config, IAM, SCPs, EventBridge, Step Functions, and Route 53/Fleet Manager. It also probes testing strategy, rollbacks, and canary validation in a real-world enterprise.

## Key Concepts

- Cross-account governance with SCPs and IAM Access Analyzer
- Multi-region failover orchestration with EventBridge and Step Functions
- GPU workload management (EC2 P-series, autoscaling, quotas)
- Credential rotation and secret management (KMS, Secrets Manager)
- Canary testing and rollback planning

## Code Example

